  "id": "baked-eggs-with-spinach-tomatoes-ricotta-and-basil",
  "name": "Baked Eggs with Spinach, Tomatoes, Ricotta, and Basil",
  "subtitle": "A skillet of eggs in rich tomato sauce with greens and creamy cheese",
  "description": "Simmer a tomato and spinach sauce, add eggs and cheese, then grill until the eggs are fully set.",
